sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Istio Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant PreProc as payload-pre-processing<br/>9004/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant Kuadrant as Kuadrant Auth<br/>WasmPlugin
    participant PostProc as payload-processing<br/>9004/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant EPP as InferencePool / EPP<br/>ExtProc
    participant Model as Upstream Model Server
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Kubelet as kubelet
    participant Prom as Prometheus

    Note over Client,Model: Flow 1: Pre-Auth Model Routing

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Gateway->>PreProc: gRPC ExtProc (H2)<br/>TLS (self-signed)<br/>Request headers + body
    PreProc->>K8sAPI: Read ExternalProviders/ExternalModels<br/>HTTPS, ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>PreProc: Provider resolution data
    PreProc-->>Gateway: ProcessingResponse<br/>Add X-Gateway-Model-Name header<br/>Resolve model provider
    Gateway->>Kuadrant: Forward with routing headers<br/>Inline filter (WasmPlugin)
    Kuadrant-->>Gateway: Auth decision (allow/deny)

    Note over Client,Model: Flow 2: Post-Auth Request/Response Processing

    Gateway->>PostProc: gRPC ExtProc (H2)<br/>TLS (self-signed)<br/>Request headers + body
    PostProc->>K8sAPI: Read configmaps, secrets<br/>HTTPS, ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>PostProc: Configuration data
    PostProc-->>Gateway: ProcessingResponse<br/>Header/body mutations
    Gateway->>EPP: ExtProc (gRPC)<br/>TLS
    EPP-->>Gateway: Routing decision
    Gateway->>Model: Forward to upstream<br/>HTTP/gRPC, TLS, Bearer/mTLS
    Model-->>Gateway: Model response
    Gateway->>PostProc: gRPC ExtProc (H2)<br/>Response headers + body
    PostProc-->>Gateway: Response mutations
    Gateway-->>Client: Final response

    Note over Kubelet,Prom: Flow 3: Health and Monitoring

    Kubelet->>PostProc: gRPC health check<br/>50052/TCP, no TLS
    PostProc-->>Kubelet: SERVING / NOT_SERVING
    Prom->>PostProc: GET /metrics<br/>9090/TCP HTTP/1.1
    PostProc-->>Prom: Prometheus text format
